Oxygen Not Included is developed and published by Klei Entertainment. This project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Klei Entertainment.

This repository contains no file of the game: no Klei source code, game binaries, game
assets or game data. Building it needs an installed copy of the game. The build reads
the layouts of the game's simulation messages from the installed Assembly-CSharp.dll
(.NET metadata only) and writes them to abi/sim_abi.h, which is not part of this
repository or of any release.

No third-party source code is included.
